1000 agents, longevity 8, maturity 2, cap 1500, 1200 ticks

starting at 25% male
tick         male   mean mcc
0            0.24       0.25
50           0.30       0.28
200          0.34       0.35
600          0.46       0.46
1200         0.49       0.49

starting at 75% male
tick         male   mean mcc
0            0.78       0.75
50           0.72       0.72
200          0.66       0.66
600          0.58       0.57
1200         0.54       0.53

from either side, the adult sex ratio converges on 1/2 and the inherited
male-child probability follows it: Fisher's principle
